      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["# FLUX.2 Base 4B native-reference Krea2 comparison\n\nDirect adaptation of Comfy-Org's official FLUX.2 Klein Base 4B single-reference edit subgraph. The reference is VAE-encoded once and attached with `ReferenceLatent` to both positive and negative conditioning. No LoRA, crop, output mask, inpaint, face swap, composite, face restoration, sharpening, or finishing node. Local substitutions: installed FP8 Qwen 3 4B encoder and `flux2-vae.safetensors`. Test: 20 steps, CFG 5, Euler, seed 9472363, 832×1248.\n\n**2026-08-24 result: preserved as a failed identity/realism comparison, not promoted.** Native integration had no cutout halo, but identity ranked below Krea2 (0.5691 vs 0.6330), the face/body drifted, and the crowd was repetitive and over-clean. More steps were not run because they cannot repair a failed identity-conditioning mechanism."]
    }
